#' Biweight Variance Function
#'
#' @description
#' Helper function for biweight M-estimator. Computes v(x) = x * psi(x) where
#' psi is the biweight influence function.
#'
#' @param x Standardized residuals.
#' @param c1 Tuning constant for biweight.
#' @param M Location estimate (typically median).
#'
#' @return Vector of v(x) values used in variance estimation.
#'
#' @keywords internal robust
#' @export
v.bt <- function(x,c1,M) return(x*psi.bt(x,c1,M))




