# vecnorm

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

#' Vector p-Norm
#'
#' @description
#' Computes the p-norm of a vector: ||x||_p = (sum(|x|^p))^(1/p).
#'
#' @param x Numeric vector.
#' @param p Norm parameter (default: 2 for Euclidean norm). Common values:
#'   1 (Manhattan), 2 (Euclidean), Inf (maximum norm).
#'
#' @return Scalar p-norm of the vector.
#'
#' @export
#' @keywords math
vecnorm<-function(x, p=2) sum(x^p)^(1/p)




